  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "ロトムパワーの　ひとつ。　つかうと\nめのまえにいる　やせいポケモンが\nとても　つかまえやすくなる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "로토무파워 중 하나. 사용하면\n눈앞에 있는 야생 포켓몬을\n매우 잡기 쉬워진다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "洛托姆之力的一種。\n使用後，可以讓眼前的\n寶可夢變得非常容易捕捉。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une des Motism’Auras. Elle permet d’attraper\nbeaucoup plus facilement le Pokémon sauvage\nque vous affrontez.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Diese Rotom-Kraft bewirkt, dass wilde Pokémon\nmit höherer Wahrscheinlichkeit gefangen werden.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Poder Rotom que aumenta mucho la probabilidad\nde capturar al Pokémon salvaje al que te estés\nenfrentando.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Potere Rotom che rende considerevolmente\npiù facile catturare i Pokémon selvatici.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "One of the Rotom Powers.\nIt increases the chance to catch Pokémon\na lot.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
